{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50423","headline":"三五 · 王梵志","name":"三五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲得依（一本作「於」。\n）身吉。\n无过作是非。\n（一本作「莫作非」）。\n但知牢闭口，祸去阿你（一本作埿。\n）来。\n（「阿你来」，斯二七一○、斯三三九三、伯四○九四卷作「阿宁来」，伯三五五八、伯三六五六卷作「自然离」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}